                                                "sense_id": "9f87d429-20ab-37de-94f0-2161a49857b1",
                                                "text": "Starting at the zero-gravity of earth's core, accumulative acceleration is easily built up in a four-thousand-mile tube."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd6a2a23-e595-485c-bbb1-1475071cc3b2",
                                                "sense_id": "9f87d429-20ab-37de-94f0-2161a49857b1",
                                                "text": "A gravity-free world, or zero gravity, or weightlessness is ... a relative thing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87c6cd15-1823-4145-9b74-471c922874fb",
                                                "sense_id": "9f87d429-20ab-37de-94f0-2161a49857b1",
                                                "text": "The tricky part is dressing while floating in zero gravity!"
